msgid "表面"
msgstr "Surfaces"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/surface.md:3
#: 9b8ae6491a5d4eae84e964d45ebd005d
msgid ""
"与卡片 UI 的“表面”分组一致。当前 `Random Slab` 根据晶面、厚度和真空设置生成自由表面； "
"如果还要加入空位或吸附原子，应在它之后连接“缺陷”分组中的对应卡片。"
msgstr ""
"This section matches the `Surfaces` group in the card picker. `Random Slab` creates a"
" free surface from the specified plane, thickness, and vacuum settings. To add "
"vacancies or adsorbates, connect the corresponding card from the `Defects` group "
"after it."
